### FindBack API — manual requests
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains' built-in
### HTTP client. Run requests top to bottom; @token is filled in
### automatically from the login response if your client supports it.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Register a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get current user (paste the token from the login response above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Expect 401: no token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### Expect 401: wrong password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Expect 409: duplicate email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ============================================================
### Items API — replace PASTE_TOKEN_HERE and PASTE_ITEM_ID_HERE
### ============================================================

### Create a LOST item
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "type": "LOST",
  "name": "Black Wallet",
  "category": "WALLET",
  "description": "Black leather wallet with three cards inside",
  "location": "College Library",
  "city": "Chennai",
  "date": "2026-09-05",
  "additionalDetails": "Small black leather wallet",
  "identifyingCharacteristics": "Scratch on the front"
}

### List all active items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items

### List with filters + pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items?type=LOST&category=WALLET&city=Chennai&page=1&limit=10

### Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items?search=black wallet

### Get a single item
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/PASTE_ITEM_ID_HERE

### Get my items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/my
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Get my items, filtered
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/my?type=LOST&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Update an item (owner or admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/items/PASTE_ITEM_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "description": "Updated description",
  "city": "Chennai"
}

### Mark an item's status (owner or admin only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/items/PASTE_ITEM_ID_HERE/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "status": "RECOVERED"
}

### Delete an item (owner or admin only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/items/PASTE_ITEM_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Expect 401: update without a token
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/items/PASTE_ITEM_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "should not work"
}


### ============================================================
### Matches API — replace PASTE_TOKEN_HERE and PASTE_MATCH_ID_HERE
### ============================================================

### Run the matching engine (any authenticated user)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/matches/run
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Get my matches (lost or found items I own)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/matches
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Get one match (must own the lost or found item involved, or be ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/matches/PASTE_MATCH_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Accept a match
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/matches/PASTE_MATCH_ID_HERE/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "status": "ACCEPTED"
}

### Reject a match
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/matches/PASTE_MATCH_ID_HERE/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "status": "REJECTED"
}

### Expect 401: run matching without a token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/matches/run

### Expect 403/404: fetch a match you're not involved in / that doesn't exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/matches/not-a-real-id
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE


### ============================================================
### Image Upload API — replace PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
### ============================================================

### Upload an item image (multipart/form-data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/image
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-photo.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--


### ============================================================
### Contact Requests API — replace PASTE_TOKEN_HERE and IDs
### ============================================================

### Send a contact request to an item reporter
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contact-requests
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemId": "PASTE_ITEM_ID_HERE",
  "message": "Hi, I think this item belongs to me! Can we verify details?"
}

### Get received contact requests (for items I reported)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contact-requests/received
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Get sent contact requests (requests I initiated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contact-requests/sent
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Accept a contact request (reveals mutual contact info)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/contact-requests/PASTE_REQUEST_ID_HERE/status
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACCEPTED"
}

### Decline/reject a contact request
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/contact-requests/PASTE_REQUEST_ID_HERE/status
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "REJECTED"
}


### ============================================================
### Notifications API — replace PASTE_TOKEN_HERE and IDs
### ============================================================

### Get all notifications for current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Get unread notifications count (used by Navbar bell badge)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Mark a specific notification as read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/PASTE_NOTIFICATION_ID_HERE/read
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Mark all notifications as read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Delete a notification
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/PASTE_NOTIFICATION_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE


### ============================================================
### Admin API — Requires ADMIN role (use admin token)
### ============================================================

### Get platform-wide statistics (KPI cards)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### List registered users (supports ?page=1&limit=10&search=alice&role=USER)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### Change user role (promote to ADMIN or demote to USER)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/PASTE_USER_ID_HERE/role
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### Delete a user account (with cascading cleanup of items and images)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/PASTE_USER_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### List all platform items for moderation (supports filters: type, status, category, search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/items?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE



